Z||000000||Bluemagic||03-17-2001||10:45 AM||||Any of these engine can gain extra horse power by making a few changes like exhaust work (performance muffler and bigger pipes)MSD ignition,high performance  coil forced air system(better air filters,under drive pullies and so on.It is possible that with bolt on accessories you can go where ever you want to go with horse power,the first thing I would go with is mufflers as you could pick up 20 hp/35-40ftlb of torque so this set up is the best for the average poor guy which most of us are we don't drive vipers or C5 corvettes but sure feel when our rich when our piece of #@*+= fiero stomp on them and show them my butt and a big sticker that says "You Loose".||||reg||1
