Z||000003||rockcrawl||03-17-2001||05:20 PM||||The 4100 does use tubey manifolds and the 4.9 uses cast iron. I want to use the 4.1 manifolds on my 4.9 to reduce weight, but I haven't checked port sizes yet. The 4.1 definately has a smaller outlet size  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> .||||reg||1
